@startuml
actor Customer
boundary View
control Controller
entity Model
database Database
Customer -> View : Membuka halaman dashboard
View -> Controller : GET /broadcast-maintenance/active
Controller -> Model : broadcastAktif()
Model -> Database : SELECT broadcast aktif dan belum dibaca
Database --> Model : data broadcast
Model --> Controller : daftar broadcast aktif
Controller --> View : 200 daftar broadcast aktif
View --> Customer : Menampilkan banner broadcast di sidebar
Customer -> View : Menutup banner
View -> Controller : POST /broadcast-maintenance/{id}/read
Controller -> Model : tandaiDibaca()
Model -> Database : INSERT broadcast reads
Database --> Model : catatan dibaca
Controller --> View : 200 ditandai sudah dibaca
View --> Customer : Menyembunyikan banner broadcast
@enduml
